    "verifiedFacts": [
      "The SEC publishes the Insider Transactions Data Sets quarterly and describes them as as-filed flattened data extracted from Forms 3, 4 and 5 ownership XML submissions.",
      "SUBMISSION.tsv has ACCESSION_NUMBER as its primary key and contains FILING_DATE, DOCUMENT_TYPE, ISSUERCIK, ISSUERNAME and ISSUERTRADINGSYMBOL.",
